The firm operates a small pool fleet for assignments where individual rental bookings would be neither practical nor economical, particularly for multi-site rural work and for equipment transport between nearby offices. The fleet is administered by the Berlin office on behalf of all locations, and vehicles are reserved through the corporate portal in the same way as rental cars. Each category exists for a defined purpose; requesting a larger category than the assignment requires is a booking mismatch and will be questioned by the Travel Desk at reservation time, before it becomes a Finance question afterwards.

