== Driver Safety and Incident Reporting

Anyone who drives a rental, pool, or personal vehicle on firm business is responsible for operating it legally, rested, and unhurried. The firm's insurance position depends on drivers holding valid entitlements for the vehicle class and jurisdiction, and the portal verifies licence validity when a driving booking is made. Scheduled breaks on long drives are part of the trip plan, not optional courtesy; where a traveler anticipates driving after a full working day, the trip plan is restructured rather than the driving extended into fatigue.

