== Frequently Asked Questions

*Q: My taxi receipt does not show the pickup and drop-off addresses. Is it still valid?*\
A: Yes, provided it shows the operator, date, time, and fare. State the route in the note so Finance can apply the airport and rail station transfer rule.

*Q: The taxi driver charged a waiting time or luggage surcharge. Is it reimbursable?*\
A: Yes. Metered surcharges printed on the receipt form part of the fare and are treated like the fare itself.

*Q: What if I am involved in a traffic collision while driving a rental car on business?*\
A: First, ensure all parties are safe and notify local emergency services if necessary. Then immediately contact the rental agency emergency line and notify Noice & Toit Legal Operations within 24 hours so our corporate insurer can open a claim file.
